{
  "name": "Rhythm Engineering - Firecrawl Ingestion",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.firecrawl.dev/v1/crawl",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"url\": \"https://rhythmengineering.com\",\n  \"limit\": 50,\n  \"scrapeOptions\": {\n    \"formats\": [\"markdown\"]\n  }\n}"
      },
      "id": "crawl",
      "name": "Start Firecrawl",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [450, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "firecrawl-creds",
          "name": "Firecrawl API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 30,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "wait",
      "name": "Wait for Crawl",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [650, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://api.firecrawl.dev/v1/crawl/{{ $('Start Firecrawl').item.json.id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "status",
      "name": "Get Crawl Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [850, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "firecrawl-creds",
          "name": "Firecrawl API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const response = $input.first().json;\nconst results = [];\n\n// Check if crawl is complete\nif (response.status !== 'completed') {\n  // Return info to wait more if needed\n  return [{ json: { status: response.status, message: 'Crawl still in progress. Run again or increase wait time.' } }];\n}\n\nconst data = response.data || [];\n\nfor (const page of data) {\n  const markdown = page.markdown || '';\n  const url = page.metadata?.sourceURL || page.url || '';\n  const title = page.metadata?.title || '';\n  \n  if (markdown.length < 100) continue;\n  \n  // Chunk the markdown content\n  const chunkSize = 1000;\n  const overlap = 200;\n  \n  for (let i = 0; i < markdown.length; i += chunkSize - overlap) {\n    const chunk = markdown.slice(i, i + chunkSize).trim();\n    if (chunk.length > 50) {\n      results.push({\n        json: {\n          content: chunk,\n          metadata: {\n            source: url,\n            title: title,\n            type: 'website',\n            chunk_index: results.length\n          }\n        }\n      });\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nreturn results;"
      },
      "id": "chunk",
      "name": "Process & Chunk",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1050, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "text-embedding-3-small",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "embeddings",
      "name": "Embeddings OpenAI",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1300, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai-creds",
          "name": "OpenAI API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "tableName": "documents"
      },
      "id": "vectorstore",
      "name": "Supabase Vector Store",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreSupabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1300, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-creds",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Firecrawl Ingestion Workflow\n\n**How it works:**\n1. Starts a crawl job on Firecrawl\n2. Waits 30 seconds for crawl to complete\n3. Fetches results (clean markdown)\n4. Chunks content\n5. Stores embeddings in Supabase\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Get Firecrawl API key from firecrawl.dev\n2. Create Header Auth credential:\n   - Name: Authorization\n   - Value: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n3. Update the URL in 'Start Firecrawl' node\n4. Adjust 'limit' for number of pages\n\n**Benefits over basic scraping:**\n- Handles JavaScript-rendered sites\n- Returns clean markdown (no HTML cleanup)\n- Automatically finds linked pages\n- Bypasses anti-bot protections"
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 60]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Start Firecrawl",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Start Firecrawl": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait for Crawl",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Wait for Crawl": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get Crawl Results",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Crawl Results": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Process & Chunk",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Process & Chunk": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Supabase Vector Store",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Embeddings OpenAI": {
      "ai_embedding": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Supabase Vector Store",
            "type": "ai_embedding",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "pinData": {}
}
